  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Safe Return and Stability for Displaced Persons and Communities in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM, through this project, aims to address the urgent needs of Iraqis in informal sites who are being forcefully evicted and are obliged to return to their communities of origin or are having to relocate under duress. These actions will geographically focus on selected areas in Ninewa and is expected to have a larger impact to other linked projects. IOM aims to address this through i) improving access to adequate housing for internally displaced people at risk or affected by evictions and ii) support households at risk or affected by evictions with the provision of legal assistance to enable access to housing and tenure rights.</narrative>
  </description>
